    "Use a supinated (underhand) grip about shoulder-width.",
    "Pull until the chin clears the bar, emphasising elbow flexion with the lats still driving the elbows down.",
    "Lower fully with control."
  ],
  "setup": [
    "Underhand grip; braced trunk; avoid excessive lumbar swing."
  ],
  "breathing": "Exhale on the pull; inhale on the descent.",
  "commonMistakes": [
    "Turning it into a pure biceps curl with lost scapular control",
